@nsobid-592C7051A4E620563D0296096D8F0AC5

# Splatoon 2 5.5.2 - Disable FXAA

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

// Disables the FXAA post-process anti-aliasing pass in agl::pfx::FilterAA::draw.
// The filter dispatches on its antialias_type field (this+0x738): 0 = FXAA,
// 1 = ReduceAA, 2 = SMAA. This redirects only the FXAA case (type 0) to the plain
// pass-through copy, so the frame is presented unfiltered instead of FXAA-blurred.
// ReduceAA/SMAA are left intact if ever selected.
//
// Patch: the first instruction of the FXAA jump-table case is replaced with an
// unconditional branch to the filter's disabled/pass-through path.

@enabled
01ACF210 06000014   // B (pass-through)   (was MOV X0, X21 = FXAA case entry)
@stop

// FilterAA layout and the antialias_type/enable fields were recovered from the
// FilterAA constructor; the draw dispatch was matched against the symbol-bearing
// 1.1.0 QA build. Retail 5.5.2 is symbol-stripped -- the site was byte-verified.
//
// https://github.com/RAMDRAGONS/switch-visuen-mods
